  m_text: 'user can place his points on any wheel, the inner wheel play is called
    is single play,the middle wheel play is called doubles play and the outer is
    called triple play.

    single play can be placed between 0-9

    doubles play
    can be placed between 00-99

    triples play can be placed between 000-999'
