  m_text: 'Triple chance is a very simple wheel game;there are 3 wheels namely the
    outer wheel .middle wheel and inner wheel .Each wheel has number 0-9 randomly
    placed at equal intervals. in every game the 3 wheels are rotate in opposite
    and when all the wheels come to halt the result is display and the playout is
    calculated. '
